1
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:04,700
Right-click an instrument to see everything you can do with it.

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:09,120
Open Chart shows it on the chart. Price Alert sets an alert for it.

3
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:12,630
Market Order Buy and Sell trade at the current price.

4
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:17,030
Entry Stop and Entry Limit orders wait for a price you choose.

5
00:00:17,130 --> 00:00:20,550
An OCO order is a pair: when one fills, the other is cancelled.

6
00:00:20,650 --> 00:00:25,330
Add to Watchlist puts the instrument in one of your own lists.

7
00:00:25,430 --> 00:00:31,000
Open your list's tab: the instrument is now in it.

8
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:37,350
In your own list, Remove from Watchlist takes it out again.

9
00:00:37,450 --> 00:00:41,970
Right-click the Bid price for the Sell orders only.

10
00:00:42,070 --> 00:00:50,910
Right-click the Ask price for the Buy orders only.

11
00:00:51,010 --> 00:00:56,070
Choosing an order opens its ticket. Nothing is sent until you confirm.

12
00:00:56,170 --> 00:00:59,080
Press Escape or click the cross to close it without trading.

